Cell["\<\
The fundamental representation of an SU(3) group is complex and has a \
non-trivial conjugate. An index of the conjugate representation is identified \
with the conjugate index of the fundamental representation:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1515225399,ExpressionUUID->"11be9b27-e9e0-4e5e-8edb-7666927560e1"],

